WEBVTT

00:06:28.884 --> 00:06:32.388
to how organisms read
their genetic code to make proteins.

00:06:33.431 --> 00:06:36.559
Recall that the order
of triplet codons in DNA

00:06:36.559 --> 00:06:39.979
encodes the order of amino acid
building blocks in a protein.

00:06:41.105 --> 00:06:43.858
And it's the translational
machinery of cells

00:06:43.858 --> 00:06:45.860
that reads the triplet codons

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:49.238
and builds the corresponding
sequence of amino acids.

00:06:50.573 --> 00:06:52.950
The translational machinery
of natural cells --

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.577
including ribosomes,

00:06:54.618 --> 00:06:58.122
aminoacyl-tRNA synthetase
enzymes and tRNAs --

00:06:58.164 --> 00:07:01.959
is a unique and special system
for making proteins